          "name": "click",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:f6250da95ad4b495e4b8b4e2749cc1422442b0ece57bc929c96c95d94f238b2e",
          "description": "Click an element. Pass either `selector` (CSS) or `ref` \\\n                       (`@e<N>` from `tree`); exactly one is required. The click \\\n                       is dispatched as a synthetic `click` event so framework \\\n                       handlers (React, Vue) fire identically to a real user \\\n                       click. No coordinate translation is performed, so scrolled \\\n                       or covered elements still receive the click.",
