          "name": "goto",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:f0a723361aa0fd819496f22609c00ba9baa14c8e13d35b06a38e7008a98197cd",
          "description": "Navigate the browser to the given URL and wait for the page to load. \\\n                       Only `http` and `https` schemes are accepted; any other scheme \\\n                       (file://, data:, javascript:, blob:, etc.) returns `INVALID_ARGS`. \\\n                       Creates a default session on first call. Response includes `session` \\\n                       (4-char token), `url`, `data.status` (HTTP status, 0 if the network \\\n                       event was missed — see `warnings`), and `elapsed_ms`. `timeout_ms` \\\n                       is capped at 120000; values above are clamped and a `warnings` \\\n                       entry reports the clamp.",
