          "name": "tree",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:f51f30cec42d5745fcf15868b80532a694f681e1e3fcaa80694ce85883f8d7bb",
          "description": "Snapshot the current page as an indented accessibility tree. \\\n                       Each line is `@e<N> role: name`, with 2-space indentation to \\\n                       show parent/child structure. `@e<N>` ref tokens are stable \\\n                       within one snapshot and accepted by interaction tools \\\n                       (`click`, `fill`, ...) until the next `tree` call replaces \\\n                       them. Reduce `max_nodes` for large pages to save tokens; \\\n                       values above 5000 are clamped. Requires a prior `goto` call.",
